INSERT INTO chat_sdk_lists VALUES('msg-history:telegram:8641420749',334,'{"_type":"chat:Message","id":"8641420749:580","threadId":"telegram:8641420749","text":"Edmond, I want to work on planning my investment strategy with you. Here is the context: you have the rapport-consultant-investissement.md file in which we detailed out all the inputs that a finance/investment consultant would need for planning investment.\n\nNow there is additional context for you: my company will be closed downand it will be announced on the 9th of September, so a bit less than one month and a half. Which mean my contract will end probably somewhere during november. I''m thinking that if I need to take some bank loan, I would need to do that before I''m actually leaving this company. That would show a stronger risk score for the bank because I''ve been in this company for seven years so I have a very stable situation. If I do this after I leave the company, then it''s not that strong of a position. But that''s only an assumption I have, I also want to validate this.\n\nAt the same time I need to be careful because I cannot take a lot of risk while I will have to change job, which always comes with some uncertainties. Although I''m not too concerned, I would find a job and make some money, especially considering that even with a pay cut I would be able to still fit in my monthly expenses according to the data that you have in this investment file that is showing all our financial situation.\n\nI would like to start preparing an investment strategy that I would then work on with a finance consultant who is someone I know and trust. It will cost me around €250 per session so I have to be very careful of using them well so it''s maximised value for money during the sessions. I estimate that I would probably need up to five sessions with her, which is then a pretty decent investment of around €1,000-1,250.\n\nI want to prepare really well for that. What I want to start brainstorming on is really being challenged and looking at the different aspects, looking at the blind spots, really analyzing deeply from many different aspects, really trying to avoid black spots, and making a really strong strategy. How could I reach my investment goals with different scenarios and then compare the different scenarios? I want to diversify my portfolio. I''m thinking of a T1 apartment because of the new law that if you rent the T1 for less than €2,300 then you only pay 10% in taxes (something I need to validate and really be sure about). I also want to check buying one or two parking spots that I rent with a charging box (also need to validate how that work, how can I charge the person renting the parking spot for the energy used etc), plus some ETFs. I want a diversified portfolio that really relies on my fiscal situation, really optimizes the fiscal aspects of the different investments, and also fits my goals.\n\nThat''s the whole context. First of all I want to ask you: what do you think is best? Should I first build a really strong prompt and only then we start working from that prompt or what do you think should be the next step? Challenge everything and ask clarification questions if needed","formatted":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Edmond, I want to work on planning my investment strategy with you. Here is the context: you have the rapport-consultant-investissement.md file in which we detailed out all the inputs that a finance/investment consultant would need for planning investment.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":1,"column":257,"offset":256}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":1,"column":257,"offset":256}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Now there is additional context for you: my company will be closed downand it will be announced on the 9th of September, so a bit less than one month and a half. Which mean my contract will end probably somewhere during november. I''m thinking that if I need to take some bank loan, I would need to do that before I''m actually leaving this company. That would show a stronger risk score for the bank because I''ve been in this company for seven years so I have a very stable situation. If I do this after I leave the company, then it''s not that strong of a position. But that''s only an assumption I have, I also want to validate this.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1,"offset":258},"end":{"line":3,"column":633,"offset":890}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1,"offset":258},"end":{"line":3,"column":633,"offset":890}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"At the same time I need to be careful because I cannot take a lot of risk while I will have to change job, which always comes with some uncertainties. Although I''m not too concerned, I would find a job and make some money, especially considering that even with a pay cut I would be able to still fit in my monthly expenses according to the data that you have in this investment file that is showing all our financial situation.","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1,"offset":892},"end":{"line":5,"column":428,"offset":1319}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1,"offset":892},"end":{"line":5,"column":428,"offset":1319}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"I would like to start preparing an investment strategy that I would then work on with a finance consultant who is someone I know and trust. It will cost me around €250 per session so I have to be very careful of using them well so it''s maximised value for money during the sessions. I estimate that I would probably need up to five sessions with her, which is then a pretty decent investment of around €1,000-1,250.","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":1321},"end":{"line":7,"column":416,"offset":1736}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":1321},"end":{"line":7,"column":416,"offset":1736}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"I want to prepare really well for that. What I want to start brainstorming on is really being challenged and looking at the different aspects, looking at the blind spots, really analyzing deeply from many different aspects, really trying to avoid black spots, and making a really strong strategy. How could I reach my investment goals with different scenarios and then compare the different scenarios? I want to diversify my portfolio. I''m thinking of a T1 apartment because of the new law that if you rent the T1 for less than €2,300 then you only pay 10% in taxes (something I need to validate and really be sure about). I also want to check buying one or two parking spots that I rent with a charging box (also need to validate how that work, how can I charge the person renting the parking spot for the energy used etc), plus some ETFs. I want a diversified portfolio that really relies on my fiscal situation, really optimizes the fiscal aspects of the different investments, and also fits my goals.","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":1738},"end":{"line":9,"column":1005,"offset":2742}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":1738},"end":{"line":9,"column":1005,"offset":2742}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"That''s the whole context. First of all I want to ask you: what do you think is best? Should I first build a really strong prompt and only then we start working from that prompt or what do you think should be the next step? Challenge everything and ask clarification questions if needed","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":2744},"end":{"line":11,"column":286,"offset":3029}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":2744},"end":{"line":11,"column":286,"offset":3029}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":11,"column":286,"offset":3029}}},"raw":null,"author":{"userId":"8641420749","userName":"Clément","fullName":"Clément de Coligny","isBot":false,"isMe":false},"metadata":{"dateSent":"2026-07-29T09:42:04.000Z","edited":false},"attachments":[],"isMention":false}',1785922924209);
INSERT INTO chat_sdk_lists VALUES('msg-history:telegram:8641420749',335,'{"_type":"chat:Message","id":"8641420749:584","threadId":"telegram:8641420749","text":"1. indemnité + chomage : j''ai parlé a une avocate donc je suis 100% sur de ces donnees: je toucherais entre 30 000 et 36 000eur d''indemnité puis €1.342,86 de chomage (2,5 IAS) pendant 450 jours max\n2. pour le parking, l''ordre de grandeur a l''air d''etre 30 000eur + frais, pas sur que ca vaille le coup de prendre un emprunt, pas sur que c''est possible non plus. A voir avec la strategie global. Pour le T1, tres certainement un emprunt, pour investir le reste ailleurs.\n3. transition: je compte commencer a chercher du boulot debut septembre et en etant realiste, je pense commencer un nouveau boulot debut janvier 2027, avec un salaire equivalent, pas plus, pas moins.\n4. oui, on peut l''utiliser et elle est d''accord, a condition que je lui montre un dossier solide qui la convainc, mais c''est ce qu''on fait ici et avec la consultante.\n5. toujours ouvert, mais on ne va pas demenager durant les deux annees qui viennent minimum.\n6. 1ere session quand on sera pret, ca peut etre demain ou dans quelques semaines. Idealement avant le 9 septembre pour vraiment mettre les choses en marche","formatted":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"indemnité + chomage : j''ai parlé a une avocate donc je suis 100% sur de ces donnees: je toucherais entre 30 000 et 36 000eur d''indemnité puis €1.342,86 de chomage (2,5 IAS) pendant 450 jours max","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":4,"offset":3},"end":{"line":1,"column":198,"offset":197}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":4,"offset":3},"end":{"line":1,"column":198,"offset":197}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":1,"column":198,"offset":197}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"pour le parking, l''ordre de grandeur a l''air d''etre 30 000eur + frais, pas sur que ca vaille le coup de prendre un emprunt, pas sur que c''est possible non plus. A voir avec la strategie global. Pour le T1, tres certainement un emprunt, pour investir le reste ailleurs.","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":4,"offset":201},"end":{"line":2,"column":272,"offset":469}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":4,"offset":201},"end":{"line":2,"column":272,"offset":469}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1,"offset":198},"end":{"line":2,"column":272,"offset":469}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"transition: je compte commencer a chercher du boulot debut septembre et en etant realiste, je pense commencer un nouveau boulot debut janvier 2027, avec un salaire equivalent, pas plus, pas moins.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":4,"offset":473},"end":{"line":3,"column":200,"offset":669}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":4,"offset":473},"end":{"line":3,"column":200,"offset":669}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1,"offset":470},"end":{"line":3,"column":200,"offset":669}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"oui, on peut l''utiliser et elle est d''accord, a condition que je lui montre un dossier solide qui la convainc, mais c''est ce qu''on fait ici et avec la consultante.","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":4,"offset":673},"end":{"line":4,"column":167,"offset":836}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":4,"offset":673},"end":{"line":4,"column":167,"offset":836}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1,"offset":670},"end":{"line":4,"column":167,"offset":836}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"toujo